            "Arc-rated to NFPA 70E CAT 2 (ATPV 12 cal/cm²) in a 9 oz FR cotton-nylon twill. Two-way brass front zip with FR tape, action back, ten pockets, and a pass-through to your pants. Certified to NFPA 2112 for flash fire. Available in regular and tall, XS to 5XL.",
